  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "She first appears when Shang Yan Fei tells Wei Yang to call her so Fang Zheng’s disfigured face can be restored after the clan banquet thanks. The text describes a slim woman in a veil, white shirt and skirt, drinking tea, with a complex relationship of favor, grudge, love, and hatred with Shang Yan Fei and a unique position in Shang clan city.",
      "chapters": [
        271
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_shang_yan_fei",
        "char_wei_yang",
        "char_fang_zheng",
        "loc_shang_clan_city"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She is a slim woman. She wears a veil on her face and a white shirt and skirt.",
      "chapters": [
        271
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "She still wears a white shirt, and a white veil covers her face. Her body curves cannot be hidden.",
      "chapters": [
        306
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Her standing rule is that every patient must shower, clean the body, use fragrance oil, and change into a white robe, or she will not treat them. Wei Yang also calls her a clean freak about whether attendants finish that wash properly. Fang Yuan names her among Southern Border’s four great doctors with Roaming Doctor Jiu Zhi, Doctor Sheng Shou, and Doctor Sha Ren.",
      "chapters": [
        271
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "first-treatment",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "reg_southern_border",
        "char_travelling_doctor_jiu_zhi",
        "char_divine_doctor_sheng_shou"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She restores Fang Yuan’s burnt skin, regrows his right ear, and then turns cold when Bai Ning Bing had chased the attendants away, until Bai Ning Bing returns without concealment. Su Shou’s manner flips to warmth at that appearance, and Fang Yuan’s narration pins the change on her pursuit of beauty, an appearance complex. She answers Bai Ning Bing about Yin Yang rotation Gu while ordering Fang Yuan out.",
      "chapters": [
        271
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "first-treatment",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_bai_ning_bing",
        "gu_yin_yang_rotation_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Shang Yan Fei later says he heard from her that Bai Ning Bing asked about Yin Yang rotation Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        273
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "first-treatment",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Tie Ruo Nan names her a rank five expert in Shang clan city when sending Tie Dao Ku money to heal his eyes, and notes that her treatment fee is extremely expensive.",
      "chapters": [
        302
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "standing-in-shang-clan-city",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_tie_ruo_nan",
        "char_tie_dao_ku"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At the Ju clan auction she snaps at Shang Bu Li to walk faster; he bows at once, keeps his eyes off her, and the text restates her four great doctors standing, rank five cultivation, prior treatment of Fang Yuan, white shirt and veil, complicated relationship with Shang Yan Fei, high position in Shang clan, and status as his rumored lover.",
      "chapters": [
        306
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "standing-in-shang-clan-city",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_ju_clan",
        "char_shang_bu_li",
        "fac_shang_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Feng Yu Manor intel later places Bai Ning Bing recuperating at her place after losing to Yan Tu.",
      "chapters": [
        315
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "standing-in-shang-clan-city",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_feng_yu_manor",
        "char_yan_tu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In Fang Yuan’s previous life memory, after Long Qing Tian poisoned Yi Huo with blue halo Gu, Yi Huo had no choice but to return to Shang clan city to be treated by Doctor Su Shou.",
      "chapters": [
        355
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "yi-huo-and-blue-halo-gu",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_long_qing_tian",
        "char_yi_huo",
        "gu_blue_halo_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Later narration lists the four as killer ghost doctor Chou Jiu, doctor Su Shou, travelling doctor Jiu Zhi, and divine doctor Sheng Shou.",
      "chapters": [
        375
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "four-great-doctors-roster",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_chou_jiu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Dying Chou Jiu says his senior sister Chen Jiu is Doctor Su Shou, and that the scoundrel who took her away is Shang Yan Fei. Fang Yuan’s narration then restates that Doctor Su Shou’s real name is Chen Jiu, and recalls that in his previous life Chou Jiu challenged Shang Yan Fei at Yi Tian mountain, confronted Doctor Su Shou, exposed that history as a prisoner, and was killed by Shang Yan Fei.",
      "chapters": [
        385
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "other-name",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_yi_tian_mountain"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "An earlier prior life summary also says that after Yi Tian mountain was subdued, Chou Jiu refused Wu clan recruitment, scolded Shang Yan Fei and Doctor Su Shou, exposed ancient history, and died to Shang Yan Fei’s anger.",
      "chapters": [
        383
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "other-name",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_wu_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Bai Ning Bing goes to her place after the Yan Tu loss, tells the truth about the bond with Fang Yuan, and asks for help. Su Shou says she cannot dispel poison vow outright, then offers a forceful method from her teacher’s unique legacy: let the vow kill the maker so the poison vanishes, then revive the Gu Master, with a one-in-three chance of failure. With that help Bai Ning Bing escapes the vow.",
      "chapters": [
        396
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "poison-vow-method",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_master"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan presses Chou Jiu about how she lifted a poison vow, Chou Jiu explains the same death-then-revival method.",
      "chapters": [
        401
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "poison-vow-method",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "During the Yi Tian mountain war stretch, Shang clan sends Doctor Su Shou, who together with Divine Doctor Sheng Shou manages to close the gap created by Chou Jiu.",
      "chapters": [
        966
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "yi-tian-mountain-healing",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "A prior life line also says Shang Yan Fei invited her with Divine Doctor Sheng Shou to suppress Chou Jiu’s glamor.",
      "chapters": [
        383
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "yi-tian-mountain-healing",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
